[00:01.308]very very fine- grained as you get close to it
{"当你靠近时会发现它极其细腻"}
[00:05.155]It's almost like a powder down there
{"那里的质地几乎像粉末一般"}
[00:06.561]I'm gonna step off the LEM now
{"现在我要从登月舱迈出脚步"}
[00:09.064]That's one small step for man…
{"这是个人的一小步……"}
[00:13.143]…one giant leap for mankind
{"……却是人类的一大飞跃"}
